# DS Tripwire fleet ALLOW list - md5s of files verified as known-good, one per line.
# Fetched hourly by every site (features/class-ds-tripwire.php, remote_list). A hash committed here
# is live fleet-wide within one cron cycle: no release, no fleet push.
#
# RULES. Suppression is by HASH only, never by path or name. Never add a hash you have not read the
# file for, or verified byte-identical against wordpress.org / the vendor. Record the evidence on the
# line. This file can only ADD to the bundled includes/known-good.md5; it cannot remove.
# A body with zero valid hashes is treated as a failed fetch, so never leave this file comment-only.
#
# Format: <32 hex>  <free-text evidence>. Anything after the hash is ignored by the parser.
